From 1e448ceb4f26cf820707cd4559c8431eddc9ea4a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: George Panos <georgepanos@Georges-MBP.netis.cc>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 10:36:05 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] rcs: implement Constellation and Asterism with DroidGuard
 fixes

Add the missing GMS backend services required for RCS provisioning:

- Import play-services-constellation and play-services-asterism with the
  public AIDL/parcelable API, wire protocol protos, TS.43 EAP-AKA
  entitlement, SMS verification flows, and phone-number verification UI.
- Register ConstellationApiService/AsterismApiService for their START
  actions and drop the corresponding DummyService stubs.
- Expose Constellation phone-number verification state through
  SettingsProvider and hook the settings entry/navigation into the UI.
- Add Messages/IMS Phenotype flags for MLS certificate/key-package
  provisioning and UPI verification without ACS fallback.
- Match stock GMS DroidGuard cache naming/casing and report Google
  account presence; tolerate partial init replies.
- Implement InstanceID.requestToken() instead of throwing.
- Request READ_PHONE_NUMBERS/READ_SMS/SEND_SMS in the self-check.
